ax CSV, MRR / churn); no money movement, no migration. **T3 trigger scan:** none beyond T4. **Bounded T1:** no. **Canonical builder:** Claude Opus 5.5 (B-CM9-120, agent 120; B-CM7-120, agent 120; earlier rounds B-CM6-119, B-CM5-119, agent 119; B-CM4-118, agent 118; B-CM1-116, B-CM-117, B-CM3-117). **Parent owner:** #641 split stack (M1 -> M3 -> M4). **Acceptance evidence:** failing-before CI-lane runs and green required checks per Fix round below. **Promotion triggers:** none (already T4).\n\nSplit of #641 (coach Money backend, FIX ROUND 5 @ `f60ed603`, 6,738 lines) under the owner's PR size rule: over 3,000 changed lines is an automatic fail (MODEL_ROUTING.md 8.2, tgp-agent-context). #641 was BEHIND main; it was merged with main `d23fa317` locally (clean, no conflicts) and the pieces were cut from that tree. Pieces: M1 refund transfer reversal (base main) -> M3 Money read API (base M1) -> M4 service unit spec (base M3); M2 package-create idempotency is independent (base main). M2 + M4 together equal the refreshed #641 tree (git diff). Prior verdicts (Sol RC 0/4/1, Opus RC 0/1/1 at 02cd3f88) do not carry; each piece needs fresh Opus 5.5 and Sol audits at its exact head (T4, money path). `tsc --noEmit` passes at every piece.\n\n**M3 (base M1, 2,799 lines):** CoachMoneyService and controller (/v1/coach/money/*) registered in AppModule; coach-connect payout reason (deriveConnectState); HTTPS Connect onboarding return/refresh landing that hands the coach back to the app; env, README and Connect doc updates; production-writes, payout-reason, coach-connect and talent-marketplace specs. Local: those specs and the lockout route-table spec 67/67. The 1,244-line service unit spec follows in M4.\n\n## Fix rounds\n\n| Round | Job | Head | Closes | Size |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | B-CM1-116, agent 116 | `cf5ef18b` | B-676-1 reader, B-676-2, C-676-2 |  |\n| 2 | B-CM-117, agent 117 | `54e61566` | B-676-3 reader, B-676-4; restack on #674 5bbcc92a; production-writes spec moved to #677 | 2,671 |\n| 3 | B-CM4-118, agent 118 (finishes B-CM3-117) | `ccd60bbc` | B-676-3 narrowed (fbd6402c, B-CM3-117); restack on #674 f9e21a87 | 2,981 |\n| 4 | B-CM5-119, agent 119 | `ecaf75fd` | restack on #674 49644775 (f6121146) + guard entry removed (5d43e204); B-676-5 + BILLED_WHERE exported (04b76b4d); restack on #674 8cc17809 (ecaf75fd); tests in M5 #703 | 2,984 |\n| 5 | B-CM7-120, agent 120 (finishes B-CM6-119) | `0ee4933d` | restacks on #674 7a10fe1a..9e8a3a6b (c9ab7316, 296067fb, B-CM6-119); restack on #674 e35c37a1 (main ee55f814 + B-CM7-1), merge-only | 2,984 |\n| 6 | restack, merge-only (B-CM9-120, agent 120) | `fadb2960` | restack on #674 3a07a0de (FIX ROUND 6), merge-only | 2,984 |\n\n\n\n\n","created_at":"2026-10-03T19:40:25Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T19:47:37Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"b4760eaa774af96236988e6871643e49442f9dc3","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[{"id":11278565662,"node_id":"LA_kwDORnQJEs8AAAACoEFBHg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/labels/size/size/XL","name":"size/size/XL","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pulls/676/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pulls/676/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/issues/676/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/statuses/fadb2960bdce1c1b700eafc1f9da02c520ea021f","head":{"label":"BradleyGleavePortfolio:agent115/money-split-3-coach-money-api","ref":"agent115/money-split-3-coach-money-api","sha":"f